## Summary
Industrial electricity rates in South Korea are lower in regions farther from Seoul, with discounts of up to 10%. This regional pricing strategy may encourage industrial activity outside the capital area.

## Key Points
- Industrial electricity rates decrease with distance from Seoul.
- Discounts can be as high as 10%.
- This may impact industrial location decisions and cost savings.


